{"track":"r","category":"벡터·문자열","level":3,"title":"값별 개수 세기","desc":"<p>벡터 <code>x</code>의 각 값이 몇 번 나오는지 센 <b>이름 붙은 리스트</b>(이름 = 값, 내용 = 개수)를 돌려주는 <code>count_by_value(x)</code>를 만드세요. 예: <code>c(\"a\", \"b\", \"a\")</code> → <code>list(a = 2, b = 1)</code></p>","solution":"count_by_value <- function(x) {\n  as.list(table(x))\n}\n","hint":"<p><code>table(x)</code>는 값별 개수를 세어 줘요. 이름 붙은 리스트로 바꾸려면 <code>as.list()</code>.</p>","tests":[{"call":"count_by_value(c(\"a\", \"b\", \"a\"))","expected":{"a":2,"b":1},"visible":true},{"call":"count_by_value(\"x\")","expected":{"x":1},"visible":true},{"call":"count_by_value(c(\"b\", \"b\", \"b\"))","expected":{"b":3},"visible":false},{"call":"count_by_value(c(\"b\", \"a\", \"c\", \"a\"))","expected":{"a":2,"b":1,"c":1},"visible":false},{"call":"count_by_value(c(\"z\", \"z\", \"y\"))","expected":{"y":1,"z":2},"visible":false}],"starter":"count_by_value <- function(x) {\n  \n}\n","id":"r-333"}